Changes in this distribution include the iPhone Duo control deck, full ANSI keyboard,
three input modes, hinge-based desktop layout, direct-route high-frame-rate policy,
presentation diagnostics, separate application identities and local signing-renewal tools.
Additional changes implement strict Duo native-pixel/aspect negotiation, transactional Mac
desktop display-mode switching/mirroring and restoration, and rejection of undersized video.
New application artwork is by DUO你电脑 contributors.

